(1917,75,0,1365,'<p>On colder-than-comfortable mornings, you\'ll love warming up in the Juno All-Ways Performanc Jacket, designed to compete with wind and chill. Built-in Cocona&reg; technology aids evaporation, while a special zip placket and stand-up collar keep your neck protected.</p>\n<p>&bull; Adjustable hood.</br>&bull; Fleece-lined, zippered hand pockets.</br>&bull; Thumbhole cuffs.</br>&bull; Full zip.</br>&bull; Mock-neck collar.</br>&bull; Machine wash/dry.</p>'),
